- `protein` (DECIMAL(8,2), NOT NULL) — grams
- `carbs` (DECIMAL(8,2), NOT NULL) — grams
- `fat` (DECIMAL(8,2), NOT NULL) — grams
- `fiber` (DECIMAL(8,2), NOT NULL) — grams
