- `member_id` (BIGINT, FK -> `members.id` ON DELETE CASCADE, NOT NULL)
- `title` (VARCHAR(150), NOT NULL)
- `body` (TEXT, NOT NULL)
- `type` (ENUM('SYSTEM', 'REMINDER', 'SOCIAL', 'CONSULTATION'), NOT NULL)
- `is_read` (BOOLEAN, DEFAULT FALSE)
- `sent_at` (DATETIME, NOT NULL, DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)

#### 41. `formula_configurations` (Metadata Variables)
*Stores calculation variables for Mifflin-St Jeor or Harris-Benedict formulas to allow on-the-fly tuning via the Admin Panel.*
- `id` (BIGINT, PK, Auto Increment)
- `formula_name` (VARCHAR(100), NOT NULL) — e.g. 'Mifflin-St Jeor'
- `gender` (ENUM('MALE', 'FEMALE', 'OTHER'), NOT NULL)
- `constant_a` (DECIMAL(8,4), NOT NULL)
- `weight_multiplier` (DECIMAL(8,4), NOT NULL)
- `height_multiplier` (DECIMAL(8,4), NOT NULL)
- `age_multiplier` (DECIMAL(8,4), NOT NULL)
- `is_active` (BOOLEAN, DEFAULT TRUE)
- `created_at` (DATETIME, DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
- `updated_at` (DATETIME, DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)

